  <metadata>
    <name>Joseph-Huber-Gedenkbank – Mika Parkplatz Römerweg Runde von Unterumbach</name>
    <desc>Distance: 8.592km, Estimated duration: 2.3h, Elevation up: 100.69431399942982m, Elevation down: 100.69431399943005m, Grade: moderate</desc>
